# The price panel 199's R2 pays at `-O2` (defect 508, ratified 2026-10-09),
# pinned where the level can be named: `-fno-optimize-sibling-calls` keeps
# this call in tail position a call, so it spends a frame a call at `-O2` as
# at `-O0`. Ten million deep, the sum printed at `-O2` until R2 and aborted at
# `-O0`; it aborts at both now, which is spec `:280`'s one meaning. A hundred
# thousand is the depth this row asks at `-O2`, where it printed before the
# flag and prints after it (this Mac, 2026-10-09); at `-O0` it aborts here,
# before the flag and after, on an 8 MB stack, and prints on Windows' 64 MB,
# so no row asks it at `-O0`. `tests/golden/run/fixedbugs-508-a-tail-...`
# asks twenty thousand at every level.
function sum_to(n: i64, acc: i64) -> i64
    if n == 0
        return acc
    return sum_to(n: n - 1, acc: acc + n)

function main()
    print(sum_to(n: 100000, acc: 0))
